      "title": "PHM Q3 Earnings Miss Estimates on Lower Closings & Margins",
      "summary": "PulteGroup (PHM) reported Q3 2026 earnings of $2.53 per share, missing consensus estimates and declining 14.5% year-over-year. Revenues fell 9.8% to $3.97 billion, driven by lower home closings (down 8.7%), softer average selling prices, and margin compression to 24.8%. While net new orders declined 6.5%, backlog improved 4.1% to 10,298 homes valued at $6.44 billion. The company faces persistent housing affordability challenges and rising mortgage rates.",
